WEBVTT

00:00.920 --> 00:02.360
You and I will go to the north

00:02.440 --> 00:03.200
With a unit

00:03.320 --> 00:04.480
Act flexibly

00:04.560 --> 00:05.240
Let's go

00:05.320 --> 00:06.400
I accept the order

00:06.920 --> 00:08.420
Forces divided, neither gate could be held. Shi Lang launched elite troops against the West Gate, breaching the city in a single assault.

00:08.500 --> 00:20.500
Even with the volunteer army joining, you could barely muster five thousand men. You committed everyone you could mobilize to the defense of the North City.

00:21.000 --> 00:28.500
The defenders' morale plummeted instantly and routed into chaos, while the sight of the blazing granary spurred the Wunu forces to ferocious heights. In less than two hours, Shi Lang's host swept through the defenses like dead branches, completely breaking Yiyang.

00:29.000 --> 00:36.500
Prince of Jin Sikong Yao fought to the very death without yielding a single step. Moved by his fierce valor, Shi Lang severed his head and fashioned it into a wine goblet, keeping it as an enduring tribute.
